<title>JAPAN: Japan PM says excessive yen swings bad for economy.</title>
<headline>Japan PM says excessive yen swings bad for economy.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prime Minister Ryutaro Hashimoto said on Wednesday that an excessively weak or strong yen against the dollar is unfavourable for the Japanese economy.</p>
</text>
